<title>UK: TABLE-Guinness 96 profit overflows forecast.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Guinness 96 profit overflows forecast.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>12 months to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence, diluted)   34.8		   vs 32.29</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 11.55		  vs n/a</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 16.1		   vs 14.9</p>
<p> Pretax		     975		    vs 876</p>
<p> Turnover		   4,730		  vs 4,681</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 960 and 965 million stg.</p>
<p>Full name of drinks group is Guinness Plc</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
